             'ride\n'
             'through it must wait the better part of a day. This is real: it shaped the '
             'procedures\n'
             'around the 1958 NRX restart, and a misjudged xenon transient was a contributing '
             'factor\n'
             'at Chernobyl. **CANDU reactors carry "adjuster rods" specifically to override '
             'xenon** and\n'
             'preserve restart capability — which leads us to the comparison below.',
